<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>For Kavana 💖</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

</head>

<body>

<div class="stars"></div>

<div class="cat cat1">🐱</div>
<div class="cat cat2">🐈</div>

<section class="welcome">
    <div class="envelope">
        💌
    </div>

    <h1>Happy Friendship Day</h1>
    <h2>Kavana 💗</h2>

    <p>
    A special little surprise<br>
    made by Satyam ✨
    </p>

    <button onclick="start()">Open Letter 💌</button>
</section>


<section class="card hidden">

<img src="images/photo1.jpg" class="photo">

<h2>Dear Kavana 🌸</h2>

<p>
"In English, they said 'Bestie.' But in poetry, they say:
'She is the laughter in my darkest days, a soul I trust in every way.'"
</p>

</section>



<section class="card hidden">

<img src="images/photo2.jpg" class="photo">

<p>
"I love you more than words, but my favorite part of us is still our inside jokes.
Happy Friendship Day!"
</p>

</section>



<section class="card hidden">

<div class="emoji">
🐱 💕 🐱
</div>

<p>
"Happy Friendship Day to the girl who willingly enables all my worst habits."
</p>

</section>



<section class="card hidden">

<img src="images/photo3.jpg" class="photo">

<p>
"To the one who knows all my secrets, accepts me at my worst,
and still loves me anyway."
</p>

</section>



<section class="final hidden">

<h1>
Partner in crime and in love 💖
</h1>

<h2>
Forever your friend,<br>
Satyam ✨
</h2>

<div class="hearts">
❤️ 💕 💗 💖
</div>

</section>


<button class="music" onclick="music()">
🎵 Play Music
</button>


<audio id="song">
<source src="song.mp3">
</audio>


<script src="script.js"></script>

</body>
</html>